1
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,510
‎What's that?

2
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:12,095
‎You have sharp ears?

3
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:15,974
‎Good hearing has nothing to do with this

4
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:18,518
‎This is all about the tremors

5
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:21,229
‎Your whole body

6
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:25,734
‎Feels it on its own

7
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:29,863
‎Why, isn't that the green young master
‎Chasing after his lady cousin?

8
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:32,824
‎I misjudged you.

9
00:00:33,408 --> 00:00:36,244
‎I had no idea you were so well-endowed.

10
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:39,122
‎-‎Come now, you know nothing
‎-‎Enough of your chatter.

11
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:41,332
‎Let me teach you a thing or two
‎Hear me well

12
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:45,879
‎Long and large is not all there is to it

13
00:00:45,962 --> 00:00:50,467
‎A pickaxe is too much for gathering clams

14
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:54,804
‎Throw a bucket into a spring
‎Blow upon it softly

15
00:00:54,888 --> 00:00:57,348
‎Press your lips to it
‎Sip, sip, sip

16
00:00:57,432 --> 00:01:00,351
‎Now why tease us so, Director?

17
00:01:04,147 --> 00:01:05,482
‎So it's a watermill, is it?

18
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:08,068
‎Splash, trickle-trickle

19
00:01:08,151 --> 00:01:10,153
‎Creak-creak

20
00:01:10,236 --> 00:01:15,450
‎Pounding away nicely, I see

21
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,494
‎"A flower must be held gently."

22
00:01:17,994 --> 00:01:20,205
‎"Grip it too hard and it shall break."

23
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:21,831
‎At this rate,

24
00:01:22,832 --> 00:01:25,126
‎how is the iron ever to grow hot?

25
00:01:25,210 --> 00:01:27,087
‎Trying to plow a parched field, are we?

26
00:01:29,172 --> 00:01:32,008
‎"Young master, care to see for yourself?"

27
00:01:32,091 --> 00:01:33,009
‎All right!

28
00:01:34,219 --> 00:01:37,013
‎In he goes

29
00:01:37,096 --> 00:01:39,974
‎In he goes to see for himself

30
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:44,437
‎The proud pestle springs upright
‎Rises and falls, creaking all the while

31
00:01:44,521 --> 00:01:47,857
‎In he goes to see for himself

32
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:51,569
‎Splash, trickle-trickle, creak-creak

33
00:01:51,653 --> 00:01:55,156
‎Pounding away nicely, I see

34
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,325
‎The green lad is nowhere to be found now

35
00:01:57,408 --> 00:01:59,869
‎-‎No matter the hour
‎-Not here…

36
00:01:59,953 --> 00:02:02,122
‎No matter the place

37
00:02:02,205 --> 00:02:05,834
‎Even in the palanquin

38
00:02:05,917 --> 00:02:09,546
‎As it sways and bounces

39
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:13,675
‎In he goes to see for himself

40
00:02:14,342 --> 00:02:17,595
‎"My lord, how many women have you held?"

41
00:02:19,055 --> 00:02:20,306
‎Who counts grapes…

42
00:02:22,475 --> 00:02:24,227
‎as he eats them?

43
00:02:24,310 --> 00:02:27,438
‎Now that's a fine answer
‎To a foolish question

44
00:02:27,522 --> 00:02:29,649
‎"I had heard the rumors,

45
00:02:30,275 --> 00:02:33,027
‎but are you really such a lecherous man?"

46
00:02:33,570 --> 00:02:34,696
‎And what do the rumors

47
00:02:36,364 --> 00:02:37,407
‎say of me?

48
00:02:38,908 --> 00:02:41,494
‎Come now, need you ask?

49
00:02:43,997 --> 00:02:46,541
‎"They call you
‎the Gentleman of the Night."

50
00:02:46,624 --> 00:02:47,500
‎How fitting

51
00:02:48,668 --> 00:02:50,295
‎"The Gentleman of the Night"?

52
00:02:50,378 --> 00:02:52,547
‎Indeed, he's a true gentleman

53
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,883
‎Strictly for adults

54
00:02:55,758 --> 00:02:57,218
‎A true gentleman…

55
00:02:59,929 --> 00:03:01,806
‎takes pleasure

56
00:03:02,932 --> 00:03:06,102
‎in enlightening worthy minds.

57
00:03:06,728 --> 00:03:07,937
‎Tonight…

58
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:13,109
‎I shall teach you
‎and delight in a gentleman's pleasure.

59
00:03:13,192 --> 00:03:14,027
‎There we go

60
00:03:18,948 --> 00:03:20,074
‎Here are…

61
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,912
‎the teachings of Xunzi.

62
00:03:28,958 --> 00:03:33,463
‎Adrift and floating, softly afloat

63
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:38,927
‎It feels as though walking upon the clouds

64
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:42,639
‎Then crashing down to earth

65
00:03:42,722 --> 00:03:46,309
‎Ah, was it but a dream?

66
00:03:46,809 --> 00:03:50,480
‎Ah

67
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:57,820
‎Have you awakened from the dream?

68
00:03:58,571 --> 00:04:02,784
‎It vanishes like foam

69
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:06,996
‎Elusive as a shadow

70
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:10,458
‎After all that chasing and circling

71
00:04:11,793 --> 00:04:15,421
‎-‎You only find yourself
‎-Yun!

72
00:04:15,505 --> 00:04:19,926
‎-‎Where you began
‎-Yun!

73
00:04:20,009 --> 00:04:22,929
‎-‎Love
‎-Yun!

74
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:26,891
‎-‎Love
‎-Yun!

75
00:04:26,975 --> 00:04:31,562
‎What is this thing called love

76
00:04:31,646 --> 00:04:36,025
‎That it lives in dreams

77
00:04:36,109 --> 00:04:38,695
‎And it lives on

78
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:43,408
‎Upon waking

79
00:04:43,491 --> 00:04:46,744
‎Why does it cling to you

80
00:04:47,745 --> 00:04:52,417
‎So cruelly to the bitter end?

81
00:04:52,917 --> 00:04:56,671
‎Love

82
00:04:57,171 --> 00:05:02,051
‎Love

83
00:05:05,179 --> 00:05:12,145
‎My love

84
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:18,234
‎THE SCANDAL

85
00:05:31,873 --> 00:05:34,000
‎As the Left State Councilor
‎must have told you,

86
00:05:34,083 --> 00:05:35,168
‎I shall be

87
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,879
‎staying in this household for a time.

88
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:42,967
‎But whatever the reason,
‎perhaps this too is fate.

89
00:05:45,011 --> 00:05:47,096
‎Tell him I have heard enough, Eun-sil.

90
00:05:48,306 --> 00:05:50,600
‎-My lady says--
‎-I could not properly see you home,

91
00:05:51,976 --> 00:05:53,352
‎and it has weighed on me.

92
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:03,863
‎I merely wished to know
‎whether you returned safely.

93
00:06:04,489 --> 00:06:06,949
‎If you would turn your face from me so,
‎what am I to do?

94
00:06:09,118 --> 00:06:11,287
‎Have I perhaps caused
‎some misunderstanding?

95
00:06:14,540 --> 00:06:16,167
‎Tell him there is no misunderstanding.

96
00:06:17,543 --> 00:06:20,046
‎My lady says there is no misunderstanding…

97
00:06:24,592 --> 00:06:26,177
‎The day I first met you,

98
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:28,596
‎I found this where you had been standing.

99
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:37,730
‎I shall accept your thanks
‎in the form of a letter,

100
00:06:39,273 --> 00:06:42,527
‎for there are
‎too many eyes and ears about.

101
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,946
‎My husband
‎could not stop praising your cousin,

102
00:06:45,571 --> 00:06:47,365
‎and he is not a man of many words.

103
00:06:47,448 --> 00:06:49,117
‎My lady!

104
00:06:49,784 --> 00:06:50,910
‎Her Ladyship approaches!

105
00:06:52,703 --> 00:06:54,163
‎For heaven's sake!

106
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:56,582
‎Please do not do this, my lord.

107
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,209
‎Give it to me, I beg you.

108
00:06:58,793 --> 00:06:59,836
‎My lady!

109
00:07:00,336 --> 00:07:01,838
‎They have been discussing literature…

110
00:07:01,921 --> 00:07:02,922
‎All right.

111
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:07,802
‎Your Ladyship.

112
00:07:07,885 --> 00:07:10,471
‎Lady So, good to see you.

113
00:07:13,057 --> 00:07:17,395
‎I spotted you from afar
‎and was so delighted I nearly ran over.

114
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:20,440
‎Shall we?

115
00:07:22,942 --> 00:07:25,027
‎I am most excited
‎about today's poetry gathering.

116
00:07:25,111 --> 00:07:26,487
‎If that proves too difficult,

117
00:07:27,488 --> 00:07:29,115
‎then I shall write to you first.

118
00:07:42,253 --> 00:07:43,463
‎Surely you will answer me?

119
00:07:47,008 --> 00:07:48,426
‎Fine, I will.

120
00:07:48,509 --> 00:07:49,969
‎Now, please.

121
00:07:58,769 --> 00:07:59,854
‎Oh, here.

122
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:08,196
‎Are you all right?

123
00:08:09,197 --> 00:08:11,324
‎I saw you here
‎on my way to the rear garden

124
00:08:11,407 --> 00:08:13,576
‎with the Lady of the First Rank.

125
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:16,704
‎Do not worry.

126
00:08:17,622 --> 00:08:19,749
‎She did not see anything.

127
00:08:25,963 --> 00:08:28,257
‎You can tell me anything and everything.

128
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:31,469
‎Forgive me. The truth is…

129
00:08:45,566 --> 00:08:47,109
‎Regarding what happened the other day,

130
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,655
‎I ought to have come to you sooner
‎and offered my thanks.

131
00:08:52,448 --> 00:08:53,574
‎Yet I was delayed.

132
00:09:25,898 --> 00:09:28,359
‎One can feel a mother's heart in it.

133
00:09:29,193 --> 00:09:33,573
‎Now, allow me to recite a poem I wrote.

134
00:09:36,367 --> 00:09:38,452
‎Though the full moon has waned

135
00:09:38,536 --> 00:09:40,705
‎My beloved is still yet to return

136
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:43,124
‎The endless clatter of the loom

137
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,459
‎Fills this lonely heart

138
00:10:03,769 --> 00:10:04,604
‎Were you

139
00:10:05,688 --> 00:10:07,231
‎intending to help me again this time?

140
00:10:08,024 --> 00:10:09,025
‎Because you were lonely?

141
00:10:10,318 --> 00:10:11,485
‎How fares it?

142
00:10:11,569 --> 00:10:13,195
‎It is going so easily

143
00:10:14,739 --> 00:10:16,240
‎I almost feel bad for you.

144
00:10:17,408 --> 00:10:18,784
‎You sound fairly confident.

145
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:21,996
‎Then when you feel
‎the task is almost complete,

146
00:10:22,496 --> 00:10:24,498
‎would you come see me for a moment?

147
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:25,416
‎Why?

148
00:10:26,292 --> 00:10:27,501
‎Do you mean to rehearse

149
00:10:28,085 --> 00:10:30,046
‎before giving me the reward?

150
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,214
‎Late into the night

151
00:10:32,923 --> 00:10:34,634
‎would be even better.

152
00:10:34,717 --> 00:10:36,510
‎I look forward to it greatly.

153
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:46,937
‎Here.

154
00:11:15,716 --> 00:11:16,926
‎Here they are.

155
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,517
‎You have copied the introduction

156
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:27,395
‎most diligently.

157
00:11:30,272 --> 00:11:33,734
‎"A girl, upon reaching the age of 10,
‎must refrain from venturing out."

158
00:11:33,818 --> 00:11:36,278
‎"At 15, she must put her hair up."

159
00:11:36,362 --> 00:11:38,948
‎"And before 20, she must marry…"

160
00:11:39,824 --> 00:11:40,658
‎Yes.

161
00:11:41,409 --> 00:11:42,868
‎She ought to come into bloom.

162
00:11:43,494 --> 00:11:45,413
‎Yes, indeed.

163
00:11:46,539 --> 00:11:47,915
‎Come now, take it.

164
00:11:47,998 --> 00:11:49,500
‎Take it. It's all right.

165
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:50,960
‎You!

166
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:53,379
‎The lady herself promised me a reply.

167
00:11:54,213 --> 00:11:55,381
‎Why are you meddling in this?

168
00:11:57,133 --> 00:11:58,884
‎It's all right. Just take it.

169
00:12:03,431 --> 00:12:04,265
‎Damn it.

170
00:12:28,998 --> 00:12:32,084
‎A husband may take a second wife,

171
00:12:32,168 --> 00:12:34,920
‎yet nowhere is it written
‎that a wife can marry twice.

172
00:12:35,004 --> 00:12:38,215
‎Should a woman's conduct
‎defy the will of heaven and earth,

173
00:12:39,216 --> 00:12:40,759
‎she shall be punished by the heavens.

174
00:12:43,345 --> 00:12:44,889
‎I received your reply.

175
00:12:45,764 --> 00:12:46,765
‎Thanks to you,

176
00:12:47,266 --> 00:12:50,394
‎I learned what it is women study
‎and commit to memory.

177
00:12:50,895 --> 00:12:52,730
‎It was most enlightening.

178
00:12:54,398 --> 00:12:57,818
‎Should a woman's conduct
‎defy the will of heaven and earth,

179
00:12:57,902 --> 00:12:59,570
‎she shall be punished by the heavens.

180
00:13:00,529 --> 00:13:02,573
‎Should she stray from
‎propriety and loyalty…

181
00:13:04,366 --> 00:13:06,952
‎In the rear garden,
‎I saw a pair of cuckoos.

182
00:13:07,953 --> 00:13:10,998
‎The male and female sat side by side,
‎singing so affectionately together.

183
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:15,878
‎As I stood there listening, spellbound,
‎to the love song of such humble creatures,

184
00:13:16,795 --> 00:13:18,255
‎I found myself envious.

185
00:13:22,343 --> 00:13:25,596
‎Should a woman's conduct
‎defy the will of heaven and earth,

186
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:28,015
‎she shall be punished by the heavens.

187
00:13:29,225 --> 00:13:31,352
‎Should she stray from
‎propriety and loyalty,

188
00:13:32,269 --> 00:13:34,647
‎her husband shall cast her aside.

189
00:14:13,852 --> 00:14:14,687
‎Eun-sil.

190
00:14:19,024 --> 00:14:21,610
‎Eun-sil, you are snoring rather loudly.

191
00:14:21,694 --> 00:14:22,736
‎Is that beef?

192
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:51,765
‎Yesterday, I took a stroll with In-ho,
‎and we spoke at length.

193
00:14:52,516 --> 00:14:54,727
‎I did not pry too deeply

194
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:57,354
‎for fear of wounding
‎the young master's heart,

195
00:14:57,938 --> 00:15:01,150
‎yet it seemed he keenly feels
‎the absence left by his late brother.

196
00:15:01,233 --> 00:15:02,067
‎My lord.

197
00:15:03,277 --> 00:15:06,155
‎Though I know it presumptuous of me,

198
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:11,118
‎I found myself wishing I might fill
‎that empty place, however inadequately.

199
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:17,041
‎Should a woman's conduct
‎defy the will of heaven and earth,

200
00:15:17,124 --> 00:15:18,626
‎she shall be punished by the heavens.

201
00:15:19,418 --> 00:15:21,211
‎Should she stray from
‎propriety and loyalty,

202
00:15:21,921 --> 00:15:24,131
‎her husband shall cast her aside.

203
00:15:34,516 --> 00:15:35,351
‎Oh, dear.

204
00:15:36,852 --> 00:15:38,896
‎What did you say your name was again?

205
00:15:38,979 --> 00:15:41,273
‎What? You don't remember?

206
00:15:42,149 --> 00:15:44,526
‎Chil-seong. It's Chil-seong.

207
00:15:46,695 --> 00:15:47,863
‎That really hurts.

208
00:15:47,947 --> 00:15:48,906
‎Was it?

209
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:52,952
‎For a servant's name,
‎yours is not so bad either.

210
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:55,871
‎No.

211
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:59,875
‎At birth, they called me Basket.

212
00:16:01,085 --> 00:16:03,170
‎Then Dog Balls.

213
00:16:03,253 --> 00:16:05,631
‎After that, Straw Mat.

214
00:16:05,714 --> 00:16:07,174
‎Because I was beaten in one so often.

215
00:16:12,346 --> 00:16:14,014
‎You find that amusing?

216
00:16:14,598 --> 00:16:17,351
‎Then who gave you the name Chil-seong?

217
00:16:18,102 --> 00:16:18,936
‎My master.

218
00:16:20,729 --> 00:16:21,605
‎Lord Cho Won.

219
00:16:23,107 --> 00:16:24,984
‎I had seven different masters,

220
00:16:25,067 --> 00:16:27,778
‎and each one had a different family name.

221
00:16:27,861 --> 00:16:29,571
‎Hence the name, Chil-seong. "Seven Names."

222
00:16:30,364 --> 00:16:33,367
‎He named me that and said the Cho family

223
00:16:34,243 --> 00:16:36,328
‎must be the last house I ever serve.

224
00:16:36,412 --> 00:16:39,289
‎Yours is a pitiful fate indeed.

225
00:16:40,499 --> 00:16:41,667
‎Wait, move.

226
00:16:43,419 --> 00:16:44,253
‎Oh, no.

227
00:16:46,213 --> 00:16:47,756
‎Oh, dear.

228
00:16:51,385 --> 00:16:54,471
‎For heaven's sake!
‎You should have taken better care of it!

229
00:16:59,977 --> 00:17:00,811
‎My lady.

230
00:17:01,729 --> 00:17:02,771
‎Who is there?

231
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:05,190
‎Who else would it be? It is Eun-sil.

232
00:17:05,983 --> 00:17:07,776
‎I have something for you.

233
00:17:14,616 --> 00:17:16,076
‎Where on earth have you been?

234
00:17:33,385 --> 00:17:34,928
‎A letter came for you.

235
00:17:37,473 --> 00:17:38,474
‎Letter?

236
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:44,146
‎Should a woman's conduct
‎defy the will of heaven and earth,

237
00:17:44,813 --> 00:17:46,398
‎she shall be punished by the heavens.

238
00:17:47,441 --> 00:17:49,485
‎Should she stray from
‎propriety and loyalty…

239
00:17:57,242 --> 00:17:59,787
‎Here, put this in and deliver it to her.

240
00:18:01,205 --> 00:18:02,039
‎Huh?

241
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:14,676
‎All right.

242
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,845
‎I'll prepare a tonic
‎of pomegranate and velvet antler.

243
00:18:16,929 --> 00:18:19,098
‎Have her take it
‎before going to bed each night.

244
00:18:20,766 --> 00:18:22,768
‎You must not miss a single day

245
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:25,854
‎if you are to make your body fit
‎for childbearing.

246
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:30,025
‎Thank you, my lord.

247
00:18:32,653 --> 00:18:34,738
‎Thank my wife for it.

248
00:18:35,322 --> 00:18:36,532
‎Isn't that right, my lady?

249
00:19:00,514 --> 00:19:03,225
‎A woman must keep her countenance proper,
‎guard her chastity,

250
00:19:04,268 --> 00:19:05,394
‎and conduct herself…

251
00:19:05,477 --> 00:19:08,272
‎She replied to a blank sheet?

252
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,817
‎So she is not even reading them.

253
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:13,861
‎How lovely! My lady!

254
00:19:14,611 --> 00:19:15,696
‎How about this one?

255
00:19:20,075 --> 00:19:21,160
‎My letters.

256
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,289
‎Do you even read them?

257
00:19:25,372 --> 00:19:27,416
‎Were you always so cruel?

258
00:19:29,209 --> 00:19:33,046
‎How can you send only a reply
‎without even trying to look into my heart?

259
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,089
‎You, sir…

260
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:39,386
‎have disregarded
‎every earnest plea I made.

261
00:19:40,262 --> 00:19:43,557
‎I, on the other hand,
‎have kept every promise I made to you.

262
00:19:49,104 --> 00:19:51,231
‎Have you no pity for my heart, woman?

263
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:19,509
‎Tie it up tight.

264
00:20:20,052 --> 00:20:22,221
‎Just take that one with you.

265
00:20:42,699 --> 00:20:43,659
‎Here we go.

266
00:21:00,759 --> 00:21:01,593
‎Mother.

267
00:21:02,302 --> 00:21:04,805
‎I shall soon follow you,

268
00:21:06,682 --> 00:21:07,933
‎my dear husband.

269
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:09,851
‎Easy now.

270
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:14,940
‎I did not know your masters had gone
‎to hold the rite ending their mourning.

271
00:21:15,023 --> 00:21:16,191
‎Dear me.

272
00:21:16,275 --> 00:21:19,027
‎We were given all this fine liquor.

273
00:21:21,238 --> 00:21:23,532
‎-My, what a waste.
‎-What is that? Liquor?

274
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:29,746
‎-Hey! Wait!
‎-Hey!

275
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:31,415
‎What are you doing, you fool?

276
00:21:31,498 --> 00:21:33,417
‎Chil-seong,
‎I thought you were better than this!

277
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:35,168
‎Well, what else can I do?

278
00:21:35,252 --> 00:21:37,754
‎I cannot defy my master's orders, can I?.

279
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:41,425
‎Listen, all of you!
‎This soil shall be as rich as can be.

280
00:21:41,508 --> 00:21:43,677
‎You ought to plant
‎something here next year.

281
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:45,137
‎-Good heavens!
‎-Wait!

282
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:47,139
‎Why would he throw such fine liquor away?

283
00:21:47,222 --> 00:21:50,183
‎Just keep pouring it out,
‎just as your master ordered!

284
00:21:50,267 --> 00:21:52,686
‎-Go on.
‎-Pour it in here.

285
00:21:52,769 --> 00:21:54,771
‎You are not disobeying a thing!

286
00:21:54,855 --> 00:21:57,607
‎-Come now.
‎-Go on!

287
00:21:57,691 --> 00:22:00,319
‎-We have some ritual food left, don't we?
‎-Yes!

288
00:22:00,986 --> 00:22:04,531
‎Chil-seong, you rascal!
‎You are one fine servant!

289
00:23:38,834 --> 00:23:42,462
‎Chil-seong, you rascal!
‎You are one fine servant!

290
00:23:51,888 --> 00:23:52,931
‎Let's see.

291
00:24:09,406 --> 00:24:11,324
‎I have this face,

292
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:14,411
‎and I even paired it with sweetness.

293
00:24:17,706 --> 00:24:20,458
‎What more am I meant to do? Darn it.

294
00:24:42,230 --> 00:24:43,648
‎I received your reply.

295
00:24:44,274 --> 00:24:46,443
‎-Your handwriting is as beautiful…
‎-You're a fool.

296
00:24:46,526 --> 00:24:48,195
‎How could you still continue to write

297
00:24:48,278 --> 00:24:49,905
‎after receiving such an absurd reply?

298
00:24:49,988 --> 00:24:51,948
‎Why do you torment me so?

299
00:25:01,333 --> 00:25:04,085
‎Yesterday, I took a stroll with In-ho,
‎and we spoke at length.

300
00:25:04,169 --> 00:25:06,087
‎I knew I was right about you.

301
00:25:06,588 --> 00:25:08,882
‎Deep within your heart

302
00:25:08,965 --> 00:25:11,301
‎lies such gentle kindness.

303
00:25:12,469 --> 00:25:14,554
‎But hearing you say

304
00:25:14,638 --> 00:25:18,475
‎you wished to fill that empty place
‎for my brother-in-law,

305
00:25:18,558 --> 00:25:20,393
‎I find myself envious of him.

306
00:25:21,603 --> 00:25:24,022
‎It is terribly wrong of me
‎to feel this way, is it not?

307
00:25:33,448 --> 00:25:34,699
‎My lord, whom I long for,

308
00:25:35,700 --> 00:25:37,827
‎please appear before me.

309
00:25:39,579 --> 00:25:40,997
‎My heart is in such turmoil

310
00:25:41,539 --> 00:25:43,416
‎that I cannot sleep at all.

311
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,170
‎Please appear to me at least in my dreams.

312
00:25:47,879 --> 00:25:51,174
‎MY LORD, WHOM I LONG FOR,
‎PLEASE APPEAR BEFORE ME

313
00:26:07,774 --> 00:26:11,486
‎I HAVE READ IT

314
00:26:14,572 --> 00:26:16,116
‎Eun-sil, are you there?

315
00:26:25,417 --> 00:26:26,293
‎Eun-sil.

316
00:26:32,507 --> 00:26:34,968
‎Do not be alarmed, my lady.
‎It is I, Cho Won.

317
00:26:38,555 --> 00:26:39,889
‎I have come

318
00:26:40,765 --> 00:26:41,808
‎to see you.

319
00:26:41,891 --> 00:26:44,019
‎What scandalous words are these?

320
00:26:44,519 --> 00:26:46,396
‎Please return at once,

321
00:26:46,479 --> 00:26:48,940
‎and I shall pretend
‎none of this happened tonight.

322
00:26:49,691 --> 00:26:50,525
‎Do you mean to say

323
00:26:51,693 --> 00:26:53,695
‎you did not wish to see me?

324
00:26:54,487 --> 00:26:57,032
‎How could a gentleman learned in propriety

325
00:26:58,325 --> 00:27:00,744
‎ask such an insulting question?

326
00:27:02,537 --> 00:27:03,621
‎Are my feelings…

327
00:27:07,083 --> 00:27:09,252
‎truly an insult to you?

328
00:27:17,927 --> 00:27:20,764
‎Knowing now that our hearts feel the same…

329
00:27:23,391 --> 00:27:25,018
‎how could I…

330
00:27:25,518 --> 00:27:27,687
‎How could I keep myself from coming here?

331
00:27:29,439 --> 00:27:30,315
‎That is why

332
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:34,444
‎you answered
‎my letters as well, is it not?

333
00:27:36,613 --> 00:27:37,447
‎I have

334
00:27:38,740 --> 00:27:40,950
‎read your replies.

335
00:27:43,286 --> 00:27:45,372
‎My lord, please do not do this.

336
00:27:49,250 --> 00:27:51,628
‎Why must you be so cruel to me?

337
00:27:52,712 --> 00:27:56,299
‎This is a bond
‎that can never be fulfilled in this life.

338
00:27:58,385 --> 00:27:59,928
‎Why do you keep longing for it?

339
00:28:10,438 --> 00:28:11,523
‎Then in the next life…

340
00:28:13,983 --> 00:28:16,069
‎will I be allowed to reach you?

341
00:28:20,740 --> 00:28:21,866
‎If so, then…

342
00:28:25,578 --> 00:28:27,163
‎send me there at once.

343
00:28:31,835 --> 00:28:32,919
‎Otherwise…

344
00:28:41,469 --> 00:28:43,221
‎I shall reach you…

345
00:28:46,891 --> 00:28:48,768
‎in this life instead.

346
00:28:52,313 --> 00:28:53,523
‎Just as I am now.

347
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,209
‎Tonight…

348
00:29:19,674 --> 00:29:21,384
‎we shall meet in our dreams.

349
00:29:24,262 --> 00:29:25,096
‎We must.

350
00:29:52,624 --> 00:29:55,543
‎She falls so easily,
‎it is almost disappointing.

351
00:29:59,547 --> 00:30:01,758
‎I wonder if she will
‎cry herself to sleep tonight.

352
00:30:21,653 --> 00:30:22,695
‎Madam.

353
00:30:22,779 --> 00:30:25,073
‎Lord Cho Won is here to see you.

354
00:30:37,001 --> 00:30:39,128
‎You told me to come
‎once I felt I was close.

355
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,632
‎So though I knew how late it was…

356
00:30:44,717 --> 00:30:46,845
‎I came nonetheless. Forgive me.

357
00:30:46,928 --> 00:30:48,680
‎You must be quite certain of yourself.

358
00:30:51,474 --> 00:30:54,811
‎I was just with the widow.

359
00:30:56,020 --> 00:30:57,272
‎Just the two of us.

360
00:30:58,022 --> 00:31:00,692
‎Very… privately.

361
00:31:02,235 --> 00:31:03,903
‎How remarkable you are.

362
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:07,407
‎There must have been
‎at least ten pairs of eyes watching.

363
00:31:10,285 --> 00:31:11,619
‎What is there for me to fear

364
00:31:12,662 --> 00:31:14,789
‎when I have set my mind on something?

365
00:31:15,373 --> 00:31:18,084
‎That woman
‎who once seemed all edge and steel

366
00:31:18,668 --> 00:31:21,337
‎now rests so sweetly in my arms.

367
00:31:23,006 --> 00:31:24,090
‎In your arms?

368
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,467
‎The widow?

369
00:31:26,968 --> 00:31:29,971
‎It was the embrace of a man
‎she had never known before.

370
00:31:30,555 --> 00:31:31,848
‎She melted right into me.

371
00:31:36,144 --> 00:31:37,228
‎I almost smiled

372
00:31:37,937 --> 00:31:39,731
‎without meaning to.

373
00:31:41,858 --> 00:31:42,775
‎Until now,

374
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:46,237
‎I had moved only as planned.

375
00:31:48,031 --> 00:31:48,948
‎But I nearly…

376
00:31:52,285 --> 00:31:53,494
‎gave myself away.

377
00:31:58,166 --> 00:31:59,208
‎Gave yourself away?

378
00:32:00,376 --> 00:32:01,294
‎What do you mean?

379
00:32:01,377 --> 00:32:02,545
‎What do you think?

380
00:32:09,844 --> 00:32:12,221
‎My dazzling little performance. What else?

381
00:32:14,015 --> 00:32:15,141
‎Now I am curious

382
00:32:16,100 --> 00:32:18,394
‎what exactly you did to her.

383
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:25,026
‎"If only I could reach you
‎in the next life,

384
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:27,946
‎I would go there…

385
00:32:30,156 --> 00:32:33,201
‎this very moment."

386
00:32:33,993 --> 00:32:36,663
‎At last, I have met a man

387
00:32:37,747 --> 00:32:39,707
‎who leaves me breathless.

388
00:32:49,717 --> 00:32:51,678
‎I longed so dearly

389
00:32:52,845 --> 00:32:54,722
‎for your great hands.

390
00:33:00,561 --> 00:33:01,479
‎And I too…

391
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,733
‎longed day and night…

392
00:33:08,194 --> 00:33:10,697
‎for your breath upon me.

393
00:33:14,325 --> 00:33:15,827
‎Hearing such words,

394
00:33:16,452 --> 00:33:19,539
‎I feel I shall spend the night
‎thoroughly drenched.

395
00:33:53,906 --> 00:33:56,534
‎"My thighs seem to part
‎of their own accord,

396
00:33:57,035 --> 00:33:59,078
‎yet there is no husband
‎to pound between them."

397
00:33:59,620 --> 00:34:03,249
‎I long so dearly for your great hands.

398
00:34:03,332 --> 00:34:04,834
‎"Come visit me once."

399
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:08,796
‎"And scold
‎this drenched little thing of mine."

400
00:34:11,674 --> 00:34:12,884
‎BUN-HUI

401
00:34:12,967 --> 00:34:14,510
‎"Bun-hui"?

402
00:34:27,482 --> 00:34:28,399
‎You see?

403
00:34:30,151 --> 00:34:33,279
‎You ought not have left
‎after merely brushing her shoulder.

404
00:34:37,158 --> 00:34:39,035
‎It came from the Tobacco Shop.

405
00:34:39,786 --> 00:34:41,496
‎From So-ok's mother.

406
00:34:45,792 --> 00:34:48,044
‎There are women all across the land

407
00:34:49,045 --> 00:34:51,339
‎who still pine for me.

408
00:34:51,422 --> 00:34:53,883
‎She is simply one among them.

409
00:34:53,966 --> 00:34:55,635
‎You see,

410
00:34:56,803 --> 00:35:01,307
‎women are exceedingly displeased
‎by talk of other women.

411
00:35:02,058 --> 00:35:03,017
‎So,

412
00:35:04,268 --> 00:35:06,187
‎did it trouble you so?

413
00:35:07,772 --> 00:35:08,606
‎Look at you.

414
00:35:10,691 --> 00:35:11,567
‎There is still

415
00:35:12,902 --> 00:35:14,654
‎bitterness lingering between your brows.

416
00:35:16,489 --> 00:35:19,033
‎It's a pity I cannot imitate it for you.

417
00:35:24,288 --> 00:35:26,207
‎As an apology,

418
00:35:27,875 --> 00:35:28,835
‎I shall

419
00:35:30,378 --> 00:35:31,587
‎give you this letter.

420
00:35:32,255 --> 00:35:35,466
‎I suspect it shall prove more useful
‎in your hands than mine.

421
00:35:38,678 --> 00:35:41,639
‎The daughter of the woman who wrote it.

422
00:35:42,223 --> 00:35:43,266
‎Teach her with this.

423
00:35:44,183 --> 00:35:46,561
‎Nothing could better prepare her
‎to be a fine concubine.

424
00:35:47,145 --> 00:35:49,856
‎Just have her recite these words,
‎and your husband

425
00:35:51,357 --> 00:35:52,775
‎shall be greatly satisfied.

426
00:35:57,488 --> 00:35:58,573
‎Very well.

427
00:35:59,907 --> 00:36:01,659
‎I shall put it to good use.

428
00:36:02,660 --> 00:36:03,744
‎I believe

429
00:36:04,829 --> 00:36:07,206
‎there may be someone
‎who needs it more than So-ok.

430
00:36:09,667 --> 00:36:11,919
‎What if I gave it to that widow?

431
00:36:15,047 --> 00:36:15,923
‎Well,

432
00:36:16,465 --> 00:36:20,344
‎it belongs to me now,
‎so I need not ask you.

433
00:36:26,392 --> 00:36:27,310
‎Oh, dear.

434
00:36:29,228 --> 00:36:32,565
‎You swallowed rather hard just now.

435
00:36:32,648 --> 00:36:36,152
‎You must be quite flustered.

436
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:41,199
‎It's a pity I cannot imitate it for you.

437
00:36:43,242 --> 00:36:44,243
‎Certainly not.

438
00:36:45,661 --> 00:36:46,495
‎I was merely

439
00:36:47,997 --> 00:36:49,832
‎imagining how overwhelmed she would be

440
00:36:49,916 --> 00:36:52,501
‎by my manly charms
‎upon reading that letter.

441
00:36:55,588 --> 00:36:58,716
‎I only hope she does not faint outright.

442
00:37:03,763 --> 00:37:04,764
‎Gye-hwa,

443
00:37:05,640 --> 00:37:06,933
‎are you there?

444
00:37:07,642 --> 00:37:09,143
‎You called for me, madam?

445
00:37:09,977 --> 00:37:11,771
‎Take this letter at once

446
00:37:11,854 --> 00:37:13,856
‎to the Left State Councilor's
‎daughter-in-law.

447
00:37:17,318 --> 00:37:18,277
‎Gye-hwa.

448
00:37:19,153 --> 00:37:20,446
‎Did you not hear me?

449
00:37:20,529 --> 00:37:21,447
‎I did, madam.

450
00:37:22,031 --> 00:37:24,283
‎I shall come in then.

451
00:37:44,804 --> 00:37:46,597
‎I am rather curious

452
00:37:47,139 --> 00:37:49,850
‎how that widow shall respond
‎after reading those words.

453
00:37:57,858 --> 00:37:59,568
‎If you want me to call it off,

454
00:38:00,611 --> 00:38:03,781
‎I shall stop the letter
‎before it reaches her.

455
00:38:04,782 --> 00:38:05,950
‎Just say the word.

456
00:38:06,617 --> 00:38:07,660
‎What shall I do?

457
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:13,666
‎Well?

458
00:38:18,296 --> 00:38:20,673
‎By all means, see it through to the end.

459
00:38:53,497 --> 00:38:54,540
‎Where is…

460
00:38:55,249 --> 00:38:56,083
‎Here it is.

461
00:39:00,212 --> 00:39:04,675
‎KWON GEUM-HO

462
00:39:40,503 --> 00:39:41,337
‎You there.

463
00:39:46,759 --> 00:39:48,469
‎Are you not Gye-hwa?

464
00:39:49,512 --> 00:39:50,846
‎Yes, madam.

465
00:39:58,479 --> 00:39:59,438
‎Come along now.

466
00:40:06,862 --> 00:40:09,782
‎So she sent you out in the dead of night

467
00:40:10,533 --> 00:40:12,785
‎merely to return Geum-ho's belongings?

468
00:40:13,828 --> 00:40:14,787
‎Yes, madam.

469
00:40:15,287 --> 00:40:18,999
‎She said it was far too precious to delay
‎once it had been found.

470
00:40:21,085 --> 00:40:22,128
‎I see.

471
00:40:23,170 --> 00:40:24,046
‎Mrs. Gang-hwa,

472
00:40:24,130 --> 00:40:27,091
‎hold onto it
‎and give it to Hui-yeon in the morning.

473
00:40:27,174 --> 00:40:28,217
‎Yes, madam.

474
00:40:37,643 --> 00:40:39,019
‎Is that a tobacco box?

475
00:40:40,438 --> 00:40:41,272
‎Yes.

476
00:40:44,275 --> 00:40:45,776
‎How thoughtful of her.

477
00:40:46,444 --> 00:40:48,612
‎She still remembered
‎to send something for me as well.

478
00:40:49,655 --> 00:40:50,948
‎Bring it inside.

479
00:40:51,657 --> 00:40:52,491
‎Yes, madam.

480
00:40:53,367 --> 00:40:54,910
‎You may go now.

481
00:40:56,036 --> 00:40:56,871
‎Pardon?

482
00:41:35,326 --> 00:41:36,160
‎Madam.

483
00:41:36,785 --> 00:41:38,162
‎It is Gye-hwa.

484
00:41:38,245 --> 00:41:39,413
‎Pardon the intrusion.

485
00:41:50,132 --> 00:41:51,509
‎My apologies, madam!

486
00:41:52,092 --> 00:41:53,260
‎The Lady of the First Rank

487
00:41:53,928 --> 00:41:56,430
‎took the tobacco box with her.

488
00:42:00,309 --> 00:42:02,353
‎And the letter inside it as well?

489
00:42:02,436 --> 00:42:03,270
‎Yes.

490
00:42:03,854 --> 00:42:06,190
‎The fault is mine.
‎I do not deserve to be forgiven.

491
00:42:06,273 --> 00:42:08,692
‎I shall accept
‎whatever punishment you give.

492
00:42:10,945 --> 00:42:11,820
‎Gye-hwa.

493
00:42:12,780 --> 00:42:13,614
‎Yes, madam?

494
00:42:15,783 --> 00:42:18,452
‎Have I ever punished you?

495
00:42:33,509 --> 00:42:35,302
‎Prepare a proper gift

496
00:42:36,387 --> 00:42:37,930
‎for Her Ladyship at once.

497
00:46:39,922 --> 00:46:44,927
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
